					<button type="button" class="kdm-faq-header">
						<span class="kdm-faq-question">Q.1. What is Online Reputation Management (ORM)?</span>
						<span class="kdm-faq-icon">+</span>
					</button>
					<div class="kdm-faq-body">
						<p class="kdm-faq-answer"><span class="kdm-ans-badge">Ans</span> Online Reputation Management (ORM) involves monitoring, shaping, and managing how your brand or persona is perceived on the internet. It includes suppressing negative search results, generating positive reviews, and managing social media mentions.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="kdm-faq-item">
					<button type="button" class="kdm-faq-header">
						<span class="kdm-faq-question">Q.2. Can negative Google search results be removed?</span>
						<span class="kdm-faq-icon">+</span>
					</button>
					<div class="kdm-faq-body">
						<p class="kdm-faq-answer"><span class="kdm-ans-badge">Ans</span> While removing links directly requires legal grounds or publisher consent, ORM suppresses negative links down to page 2 or 3 of Google search results by promoting positive, authoritative brand content above them.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="kdm-faq-item">
					<button type="button" class="kdm-faq-header">
						<span class="kdm-faq-question">Q.3. How long does it take to repair a brand reputation?</span>
						<span class="kdm-faq-icon">+</span>
					</button>
					<div class="kdm-faq-body">
						<p class="kdm-faq-answer"><span class="kdm-ans-badge">Ans</span> Reputation repair timeline depends on the severity of negative search results and domain authority. Noticeable SERP movement typically occurs within 3 to 6 months of consistent ORM execution.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="kdm-faq-item">
					<button type="button" class="kdm-faq-header">
						<span class="kdm-faq-question">Q.4. How do you handle fake negative Google reviews?</span>
						<span class="kdm-faq-icon">+</span>
					</button>
					<div class="kdm-faq-body">
						<p class="kdm-faq-answer"><span class="kdm-ans-badge">Ans</span> We report policy-violating fake reviews to Google My Business, file moderation appeals, and execute proactive review acquisition campaigns to flood your profile with genuine 5-star customer feedback.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="kdm-faq-item">
					<button type="button" class="kdm-faq-header">
